title: Systems Leave the Republic
subtitle: Another wave of secessions.
tags: event
view-if: dooku_movement and seceded_total >= secession_next and not finale
priority: 2
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_separatist.svg
on-arrival: {!
Q.secession_shown = Q.secession_next; Q.secession_next += 10; Q.fear += 3; Q.faith -= 1; SW.senateSession(Q);
var w = Q.secession_where || '';
var parts = [];
if (w.indexOf('corporate') >= 0) parts.push('the guild-owned corporate worlds' + (Q.guild_grievance > 0.8 ? ', furious at the Senate\'s war on the trade guilds' : ''));
if (w.indexOf('midrim') >= 0) parts.push('a scattering of Mid Rim systems');
if (w.indexOf('outer') >= 0) parts.push('Outer Rim worlds who feel the Republic has abandoned them');
var who = parts.length ? 'Those leaving are mostly ' + parts.join(', ') + '.' : '';
if (Q.rim_enfranchised && w.indexOf('outer') < 0) who += ' The Outer Rim, thanks to the Caucus\'s reforms, has stayed loyal almost to a world.';
else if (Q.rim_enfranchised) who += ' The Rim Enfranchisement Act has kept many wavering Rim worlds loyal, but not all.';
if (w.indexOf('corporate') >= 0 && w.indexOf('outer') < 0) who += ' This is a secession of the trade guilds more than of the people. Better relations with the guilds would cool it.';
Q.secession_who = who || ' ';
!}

= Systems Leave the Republic

[+ seceded_total +]% of the Senate's delegations have now left the Republic to join Count Dooku's Confederacy. Their empty repulsorpods hang in the rotunda like missing teeth. The Senate that remains is smaller, more frightened, and more inclined to trust a strong Chancellor.

[+ secession_who +]

- @appeal: Appeal to the departing worlds to come back.
- @condemn: Condemn the secessions as treason.

@appeal
subtitle: Cools separatism; the Hawks object.
on-arrival: outer_sep -= 3; midrim_sep -= 2; corporate_sep -= 2; hawk_dissent += 3; pacifist_dissent -= 2

The Caucus's appeal is broadcast on every Separatist world. A few systems pause.

@condemn
subtitle: The Hawks approve; separatists dig in.
on-arrival: hawk_dissent -= 4; outer_sep += 1; sec_relation += 3; cis_relation -= 6

"There is no secession from the Ruusan constitution," Garm Bel Iblis declares.
